# The Spirit Oasis {2}{U}: "When this enters, draw a card for each Shrine you control. Whenever another Shrine you control enters, draw a card." It is the
# only Shrine there is, so a second one is a second Oasis, and the legend rule applies. Turn 1 Bot1's Oasis enters: it draws exactly one card (library 11 ->
# 10): itself counts for the first ability, and the second does not trigger for itself. Turn 2 Bot2's own Oasis enters and Bot2 draws one: an opponent's
# Shrine neither triggers Bot1's Oasis (library still 10) nor, on turn 3, counts. Turn 3 (library 9 after the draw step) Bot1's second Oasis enters: the
# legend rule has Bot1 keep the first and the new one goes to the graveyard (704.5j) before the abilities are put on the stack; the first's "another Shrine
# enters" draws one and the new one's enters draws one for the Shrine left, Bot2's uncounted: two cards (library 7, not 6).

